    "title": "",
    "legend": "Interphase FISH analysis using probes for <em>MDM2</em> (green signals) and centromere&nbsp;12 (red signals) showing high-level amplification of <em>MDM2</em>. The amplified signals are grouped in a large cluster, representative of the presence of a supernumerary ring or giant marker chromosome. The three coupled red-green signals indicate trisomy&nbsp;12.",
    "source": "Angelo Paolo Dei Tos",
